{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/8f6d4fb3b594945457c2938c65be4d01.poster.avif?t=1769966619\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/8f6d4fb3b594945457c2938c65be4d01.webm?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/8f6d4fb3b594945457c2938c65be4d01.mp4?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow Eclipse</strong> is an action roguelite dungeon crawler built around magic, mastery, and replayability. Wield powerful spells, experiment with unique build combinations, and fight through a world consumed by shadow. Each run challenges you to adapt and push deeper into increasingly dangerous depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/2fb194583579ee7fa6bdeb1624e8a35a.poster.avif?t=1769966619\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/2fb194583579ee7fa6bdeb1624e8a35a.webm?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/2fb194583579ee7fa6bdeb1624e8a35a.mp4?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Battle through escalating enemy encounters and hostile environments as difficulty increases with each level. Powerful bosses guard the path forward and test your build, timing, and control of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Diversity:</strong> Each room cleared rewards randomized spell upgrades, ensuring no two runs play the same. Your mage can only wield three spells at a time, forcing you to choose which abilities to keep as your build evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Astral Lens:</strong> A mysterious device lets you influence the balance of light and darkness before each run. Shifting the world toward one side increases danger \u2014 enemies grow stronger, encounters become more volatile, and survival demands greater mastery. The further you tilt the balance, the harsher the eclipse becomes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 unique spells</strong>, each with distinct mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ upgrades</strong> that modify and enhance spells</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ enemy types</strong> with varied behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 boss fights</strong> that block progression into deeper areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astral Lens Runs:</strong> Only Light Run I is dev complete - 5 more runs are in development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nazhira, the Venom Sage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/ca0f12e15e6228ecb104b9620402fc0a7f8cd011.jpg"},{"name":"Lunar Mage & Paladin Duo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/11a9fdf4d712b025fd2703196158a90168019f14.jpg"},{"name":"Moon Axe Wielder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/bec1c92735ea058836e340f7da78ef12417579e4.jpg"},{"name":"Snow Golem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/209c0b2530c3163fba40b72e4f17d11ef3ed97fe.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow Reaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/558842493e15ece98d66ac2b4be6989584ebbb17.jpg"},{"name":"Engulfed by Shadow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/e5e0fb904449aad68cb763abc8051e70d00e9380.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Eclipse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/f020eee63edc38dca7e4ad413a7824c284d3eaa4.jpg"},{"name":"Beneath the Dunes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/659227672fc0b7c77a0ea3361017d1e639505f01.jpg"},{"name":"Light Run I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/41d2fdbe827dadc1a02826d1acedb3dae1dc5a5a.jpg"},{"name":"Light Run II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1425670/db1d7e3413ed0f15298255d33712af44003c3560.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1425670?t=1769966619","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1425670?t=1769966619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769966619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769966619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1429410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Get Involved!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/8f6d4fb3b594945457c2938c65be4d01.poster.avif?t=1769966619\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/8f6d4fb3b594945457c2938c65be4d01.webm?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/8f6d4fb3b594945457c2938c65be4d01.mp4?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow Eclipse</strong> is an action roguelite dungeon crawler built around magic, mastery, and replayability. Wield powerful spells, experiment with unique build combinations, and fight through a world consumed by shadow. Each run challenges you to adapt and push deeper into increasingly dangerous depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/2fb194583579ee7fa6bdeb1624e8a35a.poster.avif?t=1769966619\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/2fb194583579ee7fa6bdeb1624e8a35a.webm?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/2fb194583579ee7fa6bdeb1624e8a35a.mp4?t=1769966619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Battle through escalating enemy encounters and hostile environments as difficulty increases with each level. Powerful bosses guard the path forward and test your build, timing, and control of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Diversity:</strong> Each room cleared rewards randomized spell upgrades, ensuring no two runs play the same. Your mage can only wield three spells at a time, forcing you to choose which abilities to keep as your build evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Astral Lens:</strong> A mysterious device lets you influence the balance of light and darkness before each run. Shifting the world toward one side increases danger \u2014 enemies grow stronger, encounters become more volatile, and survival demands greater mastery. The further you tilt the balance, the harsher the eclipse becomes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 unique spells</strong>, each with distinct mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ upgrades</strong> that modify and enhance spells</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ enemy types</strong> with varied behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 boss fights</strong> that block progression into deeper areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astral Lens Runs:</strong> Only Light Run I is dev complete - 5 more runs are in development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Shadow Eclipse"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/header.jpg?t=1769966619","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570 @ 3.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 550Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</